{
  "sourceId": "post-mastercode-mastercard-hackathon-2015-hong-kong-en",
  "locale": "en",
  "source": {
    "kind": "single-post",
    "postId": "mastercode-mastercard-hackathon-2015-hong-kong"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "I joined my first hackathon, hosted by AngelHack at MasterCard's in Hong Kong, in March 2015.",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "mastercode-mastercard-hackathon-2015-hong-kong",
        "title": "Mastercode/Mastercard Hackathon 2015 @ Hong Kong",
        "url": "/blog/mastercode-mastercard-hackathon-2015-hong-kong/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "This event attracted around 150 participants from both local and overseas locations.",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "mastercode-mastercard-hackathon-2015-hong-kong",
        "title": "Mastercode/Mastercard Hackathon 2015 @ Hong Kong",
        "url": "/blog/mastercode-mastercard-hackathon-2015-hong-kong/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The maximum team size was five persons, so there could be over 50 teams.",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "mastercode-mastercard-hackathon-2015-hong-kong",
        "title": "Mastercode/Mastercard Hackathon 2015 @ Hong Kong",
        "url": "/blog/mastercode-mastercard-hackathon-2015-hong-kong/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The event started at 9 am, but teams from overseas began lining up as early as 7:30 am because the first six teams in line would get their own team room for the event.",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "mastercode-mastercard-hackathon-2015-hong-kong",
        "title": "Mastercode/Mastercard Hackathon 2015 @ Hong Kong",
        "url": "/blog/mastercode-mastercard-hackathon-2015-hong-kong/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Participants were free to join the event as individuals and attempt to form or join a team on that day.",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "mastercode-mastercard-hackathon-2015-hong-kong",
        "title": "Mastercode/Mastercard Hackathon 2015 @ Hong Kong",
        "url": "/blog/mastercode-mastercard-hackathon-2015-hong-kong/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "One of my teammates had participated in several hackathons, and she told me that a hackathon is an event where you use your programming and analytical skills to solve a specific problem during the event.",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "mastercode-mastercard-hackathon-2015-hong-kong",
        "title": "Mastercode/Mastercard Hackathon 2015 @ Hong Kong",
        "url": "/blog/mastercode-mastercard-hackathon-2015-hong-kong/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "An example would be developing an algorithm to solve a Sudoku puzzle with minimal code statements.",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "mastercode-mastercard-hackathon-2015-hong-kong",
        "title": "Mastercode/Mastercard Hackathon 2015 @ Hong Kong",
        "url": "/blog/mastercode-mastercard-hackathon-2015-hong-kong/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The Mastercode hackathon was somewhat different from others.",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "mastercode-mastercard-hackathon-2015-hong-kong",
        "title": "Mastercode/Mastercard Hackathon 2015 @ Hong Kong",
        "url": "/blog/mastercode-mastercard-hackathon-2015-hong-kong/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The Mastercard API has been open to the public for years, allowing every team to take advantage of brainstorming their idea or even starting development before the event started.",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "mastercode-mastercard-hackathon-2015-hong-kong",
        "title": "Mastercode/Mastercard Hackathon 2015 @ Hong Kong",
        "url": "/blog/mastercode-mastercard-hackathon-2015-hong-kong/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The goal was to develop a business and a demo using the Mastercard API.",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "mastercode-mastercard-hackathon-2015-hong-kong",
        "title": "Mastercode/Mastercard Hackathon 2015 @ Hong Kong",
        "url": "/blog/mastercode-mastercard-hackathon-2015-hong-kong/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Unlike other hackathons, the demo does not need to be completed by the end of the event, so technical skills were not as important as business ideas and graphic design in this hackathon.",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "mastercode-mastercard-hackathon-2015-hong-kong",
        "title": "Mastercode/Mastercard Hackathon 2015 @ Hong Kong",
        "url": "/blog/mastercode-mastercard-hackathon-2015-hong-kong/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Individuals can give a pitch about their idea or skill, and try to form or join a team on the first day morning for this event.",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "mastercode-mastercard-hackathon-2015-hong-kong",
        "title": "Mastercode/Mastercard Hackathon 2015 @ Hong Kong",
        "url": "/blog/mastercode-mastercard-hackathon-2015-hong-kong/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "However, not many participants gave their pitch, and none of them introduced themselves as many teams had already formed before the event started.",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "mastercode-mastercard-hackathon-2015-hong-kong",
        "title": "Mastercode/Mastercard Hackathon 2015 @ Hong Kong",
        "url": "/blog/mastercode-mastercard-hackathon-2015-hong-kong/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Once a new team is formed, they need to brainstorm an idea.",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "mastercode-mastercard-hackathon-2015-hong-kong",
        "title": "Mastercode/Mastercard Hackathon 2015 @ Hong Kong",
        "url": "/blog/mastercode-mastercard-hackathon-2015-hong-kong/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Therefore, joining as an individual would face a significant disadvantage, as they would face difficulties in finding team members and would need to spend valuable time on pitching and brainstorming before starting work.",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "mastercode-mastercard-hackathon-2015-hong-kong",
        "title": "Mastercode/Mastercard Hackathon 2015 @ Hong Kong",
        "url": "/blog/mastercode-mastercard-hackathon-2015-hong-kong/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "On the other hand, you can make a new friend and enjoy the process of working closely with a team.",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "mastercode-mastercard-hackathon-2015-hong-kong",
        "title": "Mastercode/Mastercard Hackathon 2015 @ Hong Kong",
        "url": "/blog/mastercode-mastercard-hackathon-2015-hong-kong/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "A brief presentation about Mastercard's API was given to those who didn't read the documentation in the morning.",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "mastercode-mastercard-hackathon-2015-hong-kong",
        "title": "Mastercode/Mastercard Hackathon 2015 @ Hong Kong",
        "url": "/blog/mastercode-mastercard-hackathon-2015-hong-kong/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The host announced that there is a 'secret' API from the public API, which wasn't actually secret at all.",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "mastercode-mastercard-hackathon-2015-hong-kong",
        "title": "Mastercode/Mastercard Hackathon 2015 @ Hong Kong",
        "url": "/blog/mastercode-mastercard-hackathon-2015-hong-kong/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "To do well in the event, it's essential to be well-prepared if you want to win.",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "mastercode-mastercard-hackathon-2015-hong-kong",
        "title": "Mastercode/Mastercard Hackathon 2015 @ Hong Kong",
        "url": "/blog/mastercode-mastercard-hackathon-2015-hong-kong/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "As you may have noticed, our team has a female member, who is a young designer from Toronto, Canada.",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "mastercode-mastercard-hackathon-2015-hong-kong",
        "title": "Mastercode/Mastercard Hackathon 2015 @ Hong Kong",
        "url": "/blog/mastercode-mastercard-hackathon-2015-hong-kong/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The other team members are developers.",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "mastercode-mastercard-hackathon-2015-hong-kong",
        "title": "Mastercode/Mastercard Hackathon 2015 @ Hong Kong",
        "url": "/blog/mastercode-mastercard-hackathon-2015-hong-kong/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "We are a team dominated by IT professionals, with a focus on delivery rather than creativity.",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "mastercode-mastercard-hackathon-2015-hong-kong",
        "title": "Mastercode/Mastercard Hackathon 2015 @ Hong Kong",
        "url": "/blog/mastercode-mastercard-hackathon-2015-hong-kong/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Every team demonstrates their product within a 2-minute presentation in front of five judges.",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "mastercode-mastercard-hackathon-2015-hong-kong",
        "title": "Mastercode/Mastercard Hackathon 2015 @ Hong Kong",
        "url": "/blog/mastercode-mastercard-hackathon-2015-hong-kong/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The judges then have one minute to raise questions to the team.",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "mastercode-mastercard-hackathon-2015-hong-kong",
        "title": "Mastercode/Mastercard Hackathon 2015 @ Hong Kong",
        "url": "/blog/mastercode-mastercard-hackathon-2015-hong-kong/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "It seems to me that most judges have very little idea about Mastercard's APIs.",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "mastercode-mastercard-hackathon-2015-hong-kong",
        "title": "Mastercode/Mastercard Hackathon 2015 @ Hong Kong",
        "url": "/blog/mastercode-mastercard-hackathon-2015-hong-kong/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "They can only ask common and simple questions such as 'How many Mastercard APIs have you used?', 'What is the business model?' Sometimes, the judges don't even have any questions.",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "mastercode-mastercard-hackathon-2015-hong-kong",
        "title": "Mastercode/Mastercard Hackathon 2015 @ Hong Kong",
        "url": "/blog/mastercode-mastercard-hackathon-2015-hong-kong/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "It would be better if the judges had a deeper understanding of the API, allowing them to critically evaluate the project's feasibility.",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "mastercode-mastercard-hackathon-2015-hong-kong",
        "title": "Mastercode/Mastercard Hackathon 2015 @ Hong Kong",
        "url": "/blog/mastercode-mastercard-hackathon-2015-hong-kong/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "http://angelhack.com/masteryourcard-masters-of-code-hong-kong",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "mastercode-mastercard-hackathon-2015-hong-kong",
        "title": "Mastercode/Mastercard Hackathon 2015 @ Hong Kong",
        "url": "/blog/mastercode-mastercard-hackathon-2015-hong-kong/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "If you want to test whether you have the ability to start a startup, you should join the event.",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "mastercode-mastercard-hackathon-2015-hong-kong",
        "title": "Mastercode/Mastercard Hackathon 2015 @ Hong Kong",
        "url": "/blog/mastercode-mastercard-hackathon-2015-hong-kong/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "MerchCircle is the product we developed on that day.",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "mastercode-mastercard-hackathon-2015-hong-kong",
        "title": "Mastercode/Mastercard Hackathon 2015 @ Hong Kong",
        "url": "/blog/mastercode-mastercard-hackathon-2015-hong-kong/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "You can learn more at #mastersofcode.↵",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "mastercode-mastercard-hackathon-2015-hong-kong",
        "title": "Mastercode/Mastercard Hackathon 2015 @ Hong Kong",
        "url": "/blog/mastercode-mastercard-hackathon-2015-hong-kong/"
      }
    }
  ],
